00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:41,120
McDonald's, Burger King, KFC, all these brands for years

531
00:35:41,121 --> 00:35:44,120
have been testing and looking at trans fat-free oils.

532
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,840
The issue was, for most of those chains, was one, taste.

533
00:35:48,540 --> 00:35:52,540
You know, a lot of fast food success is about the comfort food level of it.

534
00:35:52,541 --> 00:35:54,820
The other issue was supply.

535
00:35:54,821 --> 00:36:01,300
Trans-fat-free oils are based on a blend of certain corn oils, canola oils, soybean oils,

536
00:36:01,301 --> 00:36:08,460
and the American farmers, until recently, didn't have enough of those products to satisfy someone like McDonald's.

537
00:36:08,461 --> 00:36:09,760
But you're seeing that change.

538
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:14,020
It's not exactly health food, but every bit helps.

